            },
            "body": "Closing this as a duplicate of #37689, which fixes the same bug and was opened first. Sorry I missed it. One difference that might be worth keeping there: starting the timer on entry to `load_weights()` also counts the weight download, which #14063 moved out of this number on purpose. Taking the start time when the iterator is first pulled, with a fallback for the skipped case, keeps that. (AI-assisted.)\n",
